# Reference level solution demo: delivery through straight-2 entrance and exit pair.
#
# Typed delivery solution: place the typed entrypoints, then swing the spawned
# water+salt molecule onto the typed exit.
#
# This is solution.
# The level defined in `examples/27_level_typed.oml`

# Solution-placed entrypoints (the level runs unfixed).
place entrance_typed 2 3 rotation=1   # ids 0, 1
place exit_typed 3 2 rotation=2       # ids 2, 3

# Arm at (3,3): rotation 0 -> hand at (2,4).
place arm 3 3                         # id 4

# Grab the molecule, move it four steps onto the exit, then release.
action 4 1 grab
action 4 2 rotate_clw
action 4 3 rotate_clw
action 4 4 rotate_clw
action 4 5 rotate_clw
action 4 6 release
